# Phase 5D M0-D Actual Object-Only Source Run R5 Evidence-Consumption Rebaseline v0.1

Date: 2026-07-25  
Status: DRAFT_FOR_FRESH_FULL_ATOMIC_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW  
Owner: Jenn  
Agent steward: Nobao  
Terminal outcome: NOT_EXECUTED

## 1. Purpose

R5 replaces the R4 dynamic scanner architecture. It does not create a new
protected-path classifier. The frozen Protected Source Boundary remains the
owner of the exact sealed tree, seven protected-name facts, protected inventory
fingerprint and seven allowlisted blob tuples.

The R5 runner consumes those immutable upstream facts. It verifies only their
hash binding, the exact sealed tree and the seven allowlisted
`(path, blob_oid, sha256)` tuples. It does not import, compile, execute or
reinterpret `object-only-source-run-r2-scanner.py`.

## 2. Architecture rule

```text
Protected Source Boundary
  -> owns sealed-tree and protected-name facts

R5 object-only runner
  -> verifies upstream refs, hashes and sealed-tree currentness
  -> reads only seven exact allowlisted blobs
  -> emits candidate-only evidence

Future Host smoke
  -> may consume a separately accepted receipt
  -> may not cause R5 to recompute upstream policy
```

The R5 runner must not contain or call `exec`, `compile`, `runpy`, `importlib`,
`types.ModuleType`, `sys.modules`, a caller-supplied callable or a
caller-supplied scanner source.

## 3. Exact operation inventory

The prior `G03_NAME_ONLY_SCAN` operation is removed. R5 never performs generic
tree-name enumeration.

```text
G01_COMMIT_EXISTS
G02_TREE_RESOLVE

T01 through T07:
  RESOLVE
  TYPE
  DIGEST
```

The exact count is:

```text
2 + (7 * 3) = 23
```

The sealed commit and tree remain:

```yaml
commit: 555b3b538f6eb736e530c2912de678c5941f9985
tree: fd82d403e79f36f749eb7f555b4736eae3eacdff
```

Any extra Git command, generic enumeration, protected-object lookup, arbitrary
path lookup, checkout, worktree, sparse checkout or archive operation is
`BLOCKED_UNAUTHORIZED_OR_NONHERMETIC_GIT_OPERATION`.

## 4. Receipt v0.2

R5 defines a successor receipt schema that does not claim the protected-name
inventory was observed during the current run:

```yaml
schema_version: agents-os.phase5d.actual-object-only-source-run-receipt.v0.2
protected_inventory_binding:
  source_ref:
  source_sha256:
  sealed_tree:
  protected_name_count: 7
  protected_name_inventory_sha256:
  observed_this_run: false
  consumed_as_frozen_upstream_fact: true
Git_command_count: 23
allowlisted_blob_content_reads: 7
protected_blob_content_reads: 0
tree_name_enumeration_performed: false
protected_policy_recomputed: false
worktree_created: false
payload_materialized: false
Host_operation_count: 0
runtime_or_effect_operation_count: 0
cleanup_status:
result:
failure_phase:
```

The only favorable result remains
`OBJECT_ONLY_SOURCE_RUN_EVIDENCE_CANDIDATE_ONLY`. It grants no Host, plugin,
runtime, database, provider, authentication, private Memory or effect authority.

## 5. Required proof

The R5 fixture, validator and independent reviewer must prove without invoking
`--actual` or Git:

1. R1 through R4 immutable hashes remain unchanged;
2. every protected-source authority input matches its fixed SHA-256;
3. no dynamic scanner interface or generic tree enumeration remains;
4. the command inventory is exactly the ordered 23-entry inventory;
5. all seven tuple identities remain exact, ordered and duplicate-free;
6. protected facts are marked as bound upstream evidence, not current
   observation or recomputation;
7. unknown fields, duplicate JSON keys, wrong types, pseudo-booleans and
   authority/runtime elevation are rejected; and
8. source-level and fully re-signed mutations receive target-semantic
   rejection rather than an exact-fixture-only rejection.

## 6. Stop rule

R5 stops after creation of the fixed author package at
`PHASE_5D_M0D_ACTUAL_OBJECT_ONLY_SOURCE_RUN_R5_FRESH_FULL_ATOMIC_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW`.

No R5 `--actual`, VCPToolBox Git command, worktree, Host path or Git delivery is
authorized. `PASS_NO_BLOCKER` would open only a separate Jenn-only R5 freeze
decision. A finding outside this evidence-consumption architecture stops the
revision line for Phase 5D re-evaluation rather than automatically creating
R6.
